Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think's in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hopefully the Pharaoh's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.83,0:01:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That room might be filled with traps!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.75,0:01:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks more like it's filled with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.39,0:01:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but Grandpa said things in this\Ntomb aren't always what they appear to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.85,0:01:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He just means that sometimes you have\Nto look beyond the obvious. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.43,0:01:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.15,0:01:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking, I'm looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.95,0:01:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.47,0:01:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.97,0:01:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.43,0:01:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're standing on it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.15,0:01:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.53,0:01:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but once again, it's\Nwritten in chicken scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.91,0:01:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It says, he who solves the Millennium\NPuzzle must return the wish he was granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:01:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then is he able to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when can you read hieroglyphics?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.49,0:02:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot about me\Nyou don't know, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.41,0:02:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you expect to save the pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.71,0:02:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you better give back whatever\Nit is the puzzle gave to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.71,0:02:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But Tristan, what you're\Nsaying doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The wish that was granted to me by\Nmy puzzle can never be given back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.27,0:02:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The age of darkness is upon us,\Nand our kingdom needs a new leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You set home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.79,0:02:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,With me, where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now rise, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A new pharaoh deserves the\Npower of a new Egyptian god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we speak, a messenger\Ncomes bearing this gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.49,0:02:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Only after you've accepted her offering\Ncan you serve as the new king of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisara!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.77,0:03:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl holds the key to the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And you must take it from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.57,0:03:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.31,0:03:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisara!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I'd find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.87,0:03:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't safe for you to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved my life the night\Nyour village was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.43,0:03:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You needn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.27,0:03:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that guy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.69,0:03:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be fooled by her innocence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She wields a mighty creature\Nthat belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.45,0:03:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.01,0:03:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't listen to a word he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.11,0:04:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Zork's resurrection has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You must act swiftly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now use your Millennium Rod to\Nseize the White Dragon, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not your son, for my father left me\Nwhen he pledged his loyalty to the Shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go, Kisara. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you disrespect me\Nafter all I've done for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.37,0:04:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now set us free!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.87,0:04:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for me, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave me no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.63,0:05:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't take her power, then I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender your power to my son at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.23,0:05:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold your destiny, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.29,0:05:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Kisara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisara!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fate is sealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sealed in stone, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.35,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.03,0:06:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You no longer have the strength to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm doing. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.97,0:06:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what it takes, I won't\Nallow him to hurt you, Seto. Hurt him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you been listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to transform him into the\Nmost powerful king that ever lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But at what cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.05,0:06:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can become like\Nyou, a puppet of Zork?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisara has helped me realize something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I would sooner be a peasant\Nin a world still shining with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,hope than a pharaoh in a world\Ncontaminated by darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're choosing this riffraff\Nover your own flesh and blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought you into this world and\NI have the power to remove you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.07,0:07:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The part of you that was\Nonce my father is long gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I see what's\Nbeen left in his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A weak old man with a\Nheart full of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.67,0:07:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Kasara!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.65,0:07:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kassara, please wake up. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew if I took aim at you, that\Nfool would try to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, it was for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.03,0:07:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you and I can use her power to\Nrule the new world as father and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,One mind, one body, one king!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.81,0:07:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and stand by my side,\Nso our spirits may unite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.31,0:07:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.67,0:08:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, Zork's arrival is upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And he deserves to be greeted by\Na king worthy of his greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.43,0:08:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Her creature was sealed in stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.89,0:08:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know who did this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me where Agnodon is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.13,0:08:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've infiltrated Zitto's mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:09:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My son was having difficulty\Naccepting his destiny, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.05,0:09:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So I decided to help him make\Nup his mind by taking it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has finally arrived, Zitto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the White Dragon is yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.49,0:09:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now destroy the pharaoh\Nand take his place!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.41,0:09:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.07,0:09:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind has been clouded by darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time, everything is clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.99,0:09:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth, White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Mahad, the Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to feel the power of\Ntwo generations in one attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.53,0:09:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:10:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Their magic is twice as strong now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my dragon, attack\Nwith white lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark magic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, my king!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.95,0:10:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mahad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reign ends now, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've disgraced the throne of\NEgypt just like your father!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.47,0:10:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But not for long!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm about to take what\Nwas meant to be mine ages ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.53,0:10:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Serto, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind is being controlled, and if\Nyou don't break free, Egypt is doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.79,0:10:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a vow to protect\Nour land, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am protecting our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.55,0:10:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,From you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.85,0:10:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Blue Eyes, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.01,0:10:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you disobey me? Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me? I said attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kisara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.25,0:11:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free now, and I promise\NAkhenaten will never harm you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.07,0:11:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My power rests with you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tessara!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.75,0:11:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your spirit now lives\Nwithin the White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.25,0:12:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, but what are you\Ndoing in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.49,0:12:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I've been\Nasking myself the same question?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.51,0:12:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I certainly didn't\Nchoose to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, I can think of better\Nvacation spots than this dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now why don't you explain to me why\Neveryone's running around in these
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,ridiculous costumes and speaking like\Nthey're in some bad Shakespearean play?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.65,0:12:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.57,0:12:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to believe that's\Nsome ancient version of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Seto, and 5,000 years ago, he\Nfought bravely by my side to save Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I also learned that his father\Nand my father were brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.39,0:12:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying we're cousins?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.25,0:12:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know is that\Nwe've gone back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.73,0:12:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And the same evil force that once\Ntried to destroy mankind has come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.11,0:12:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I suggest you go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:12:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't safe for you or\Nanyone else to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.37,0:13:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You may buy into the delusion that\Nyou're some hotshot pharaoh, but I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And pharaoh or no pharaoh, no one tells\NSeto Kaiba what to do, is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.49,0:13:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you've made quite the comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing you or the\NKaiba twins can do to stop me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's too little too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.33,0:13:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In a matter of moments,\Nthe Dark One will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as the sands of\Nhis hourglass run out,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Zork will rise and the world\Nwill be shrouded in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only hope is to\Nunlock my hidden powers by
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.43,0:13:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,uncovering the greatest\Nkept secret of my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.09,0:13:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My true name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking of a last minute\Nplan to win this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.75,0:13:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.81,0:13:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it yourself, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.51,0:13:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And every challenge in\Na game has a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now need I remind you, you're\Nplaying with the king of games.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.85,0:13:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's review the clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.89,0:14:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,5,000 years ago, I locked Zork's\Nspirit away, along with my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,using my name as the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, as a safety measure,\NI erased my own mind. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.69,0:14:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and unless your memory miraculously\Nreturns in the next few moments,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,you lose the Shadow Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There is, of course, another way for you\Nto unlock this mystery you're looking for,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've already taken measures\Nto make sure it never happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It involves those\Nmeddlesome friends of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What about my friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.11,0:14:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say they've\Nstumbled upon your old tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.25,0:14:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,within which is inscribed\Nyour original name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.79,0:14:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If I give you a glimmer of hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be that much more devastated\Nwhen it comes crumbling down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.31,0:14:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, the moment they\Ndiscover your true name,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,their excursion will be cut\Nshort by my newest pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And who is this pawn of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.13,0:14:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I believe you know him quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.11,0:14:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, he was a faithful\Nfriend of yours until he lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell us already, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it you wished for the day you\Nfirst solved the Millennium Puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,For true friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And my wish was granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.63,0:15:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You win again, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.67,0:15:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this punk to me, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You were my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.99,0:15:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It was us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.07,0:15:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You never told us that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.91,0:15:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.43,0:15:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan! What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.09,0:15:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Something very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.73,0:15:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.01,0:16:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Go through that door and you'll\Nfind what you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But to get in there, Yugi's\Ngot to give up his wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So when he leaves this balance\Nbeam, we leave his life for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what you gotta do, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.49,0:16:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If I leave, you'll fall\Ninto the Pit of Shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.09,0:16:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.11,0:16:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally have the chance\Nto find the Pharaoh's name,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're worried about these two fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.23,0:16:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.57,0:16:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.63,0:16:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing's going down! Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.51,0:16:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.37,0:16:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's true what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.79,0:17:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta hang on to\Nyour friends, right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey! Grab on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.07,0:17:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about living on the edge. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.35,0:17:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the pharaoh's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.59,0:17:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what's it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.51,0:17:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It says, bird, rock, lamb, chop,\Nbird, bird and a bigger bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, so what's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.11,0:17:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just memorize the symbols.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.09,0:17:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find Tristan\Nand get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, you in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.65,0:17:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you three\Nwere down for the count,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but apparently you\Ndon't know when to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.91,0:17:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider this friendship over, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How right you are, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.69,0:18:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known. Akura!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.79,0:18:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the real fun can start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.09,0:18:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we're unable to see\Nwhat goes on in that tomb of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I had to guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.85,0:18:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say your friends were sent plummeting
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.73,0:18:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,into the shadows at the\Nhands of my other half.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.01,0:18:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They may even have\Nlocated your name first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.11,0:18:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But sadly, that information will\Nnever make its way to you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.57,0:18:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I mention that time is up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark One is about to\Nmake his grand entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.31,0:18:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.27,0:19:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We both know there's\Nonly one way to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.23,0:19:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no way you're leaving\Nhere with the Pharaoh's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.01,0:19:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a duel disk! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now prepare yourself for your final duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for listening.
